  "adaptations": [
    "Read request-owned retained root/revision/preorder/family identities without any original tree or Yoga mutation",
    "Include Modal root-kind and hidden/display-none retained descendants; physical visibility and native window admission remain separate",
    "Validate generated metadata and original core editor identities without copying field values or selection into native metadata",
    "Reuse the already approved and retained Android mBinding descriptor, without adding private renderer fields",
    "Gate only accessibilityCustomContent getter/conformance on exact registered RCTUITextField/RCTUITextView classes; unregistered/retired editors fall through to the original getter"
